    "detailed_description": "Devil Seeds is a game that mixes horror and RPG.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe story takes place on a ghost island, where the player must survive and uncover the mysteries of the place through battles, exploration and solving puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOn the journey, the protagonist duo will acquire new skills, meet scary (or friendly) creatures and discover more about that terrible place and even worse, about themselves.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat to expect?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Survival Horror mechanics such as exploration, puzzle solving and file investigation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- RPG mechanics, such as turn-based battles, character progression, level and resource farming.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2014 Rewarding exploration, where the player can interact and investigate almost everything around them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2014 Two funny protagonists<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2014 Rich and enigmatic plot.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 3 cute cats. (or not.)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game will be divided into chapters, which will be released as they are ready.",
